meta {
  name: 07_PartyKinds
  seq: 7
}

docs {
  Scenario: The kinds of caller the endpoint resolves

    When a self identified user lists authorized parties
    Then only that user's own party is returned, typed as self identified
    When an ID-porten user registered by email lists authorized parties
    Then the party carries the email identifier
    When a rightholder with access packages lists authorized parties
    Then the organisation that gave the packages is returned
    When a rightholder without access packages lists authorized parties
    Then the party list is empty
    When a system user lists authorized parties
    Then the organisation the system user belongs to is returned
}
